    "demo": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Icon buttons demo</title>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n        --bg: #ffffff;\n        --fg: #1a1a1a;\n        --accent: #0b57d0;\n        --heart: #b3261e;\n      }\n      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n        :root {\n          --bg: #121212;\n          --fg: #f0f0f0;\n          --accent: #8ab4f8;\n          --heart: #ffb4ab;\n        }\n      }\n      body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 2rem 1rem;\n        font:\n          1rem/1.5 system-ui,\n          sans-serif;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n      }\n      main {\n        max-width: 40rem;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      .icon-button {\n        display: inline-grid;\n        place-items: center;\n        width: 2.75rem;\n        height: 2.75rem;\n        padding: 0;\n        border: 2px solid var(--fg);\n        border-radius: 0.375rem;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n        cursor: pointer;\n      }\n      .icon-button svg {\n        width: 1.5rem;\n        height: 1.5rem;\n      }\n      .icon-button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] {\n        color: var(--heart);\n        border-color: var(--heart);\n      }\n      .icon-button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] .heart {\n        fill: currentColor;\n      }\n      :focus-visible {\n        outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n        outline-offset: 2px;\n      }\n      ul {\n        list-style: none;\n        padding: 0;\n      }\n      li {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 1rem;\n        padding: 0.5rem 0;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--fg);\n      }\n      .bar {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 0.75rem;\n        align-items: center;\n      }\n      .tip {\n        position: relative;\n      }\n      .tip [role=\"tooltip\"] {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: calc(100% + 0.25rem);\n        left: 50%;\n        translate: -50% 0;\n        padding: 0.125rem 0.5rem;\n        border-radius: 0.25rem;\n        background: var(--fg);\n        color: var(--bg);\n        font-size: 0.875rem;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n        pointer-events: none;\n        opacity: 0;\n      }\n      .tip:hover [role=\"tooltip\"],\n      .tip:focus-within [role=\"tooltip\"] {\n        opacity: 1;\n      }\n      .visually-hidden {\n        position: absolute;\n        width: 1px;\n        height: 1px;\n        margin: -1px;\n        padding: 0;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        clip-path: inset(50%);\n        white-space: nowrap;\n        border: 0;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main>\n      <div class=\"bar\">\n        <h1>Your cart</h1>\n        <span class=\"tip\">\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            class=\"icon-button\"\n            id=\"fav\"\n            aria-pressed=\"false\"\n            aria-describedby=\"fav-tip\"\n          >\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n              <path\n                class=\"heart\"\n                d=\"M12 21s-7-4.5-9.5-9A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 12 6a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.5 6C19 16.5 12 21 12 21z\"\n                fill=\"none\"\n                stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                stroke-width=\"2\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n            <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Save cart for later</span>\n          </button>\n          <span role=\"tooltip\" id=\"fav-tip\">Save cart for later</span>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <ul>\n        <li>\n          <span id=\"item-1\">Rain jacket</span>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            class=\"icon-button\"\n            aria-label=\"Remove Rain jacket\"\n          >\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n              <path\n                d=\"M4 7h16M9 7V4h6v3M6 7l1 13h10l1-13\"\n                fill=\"none\"\n                stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                stroke-width=\"2\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span id=\"item-2\">Hiking boot</span>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            class=\"icon-button\"\n            aria-label=\"Remove Hiking boot\"\n          >\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n              <path\n                d=\"M4 7h16M9 7V4h6v3M6 7l1 13h10l1-13\"\n                fill=\"none\"\n                stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                stroke-width=\"2\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>\n        <a href=\"#help\" class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"Help\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n            <circle\n              cx=\"12\"\n              cy=\"12\"\n              r=\"9\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n            />\n            <path\n              d=\"M9.5 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.5 2.3c-.6.3-1 .8-1 1.5V14M12 17h.01\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n            />\n          </svg>\n        </a>\n      </p>\n      <p id=\"log\" role=\"status\"></p>\n    </main>\n    <script>\n      const fav = document.getElementById(\"fav\");\n      const log = document.getElementById(\"log\");\n      fav.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        const pressed = fav.getAttribute(\"aria-pressed\") === \"true\";\n        fav.setAttribute(\"aria-pressed\", String(!pressed));\n      });\n      for (const button of document.querySelectorAll(\"li .icon-button\")) {\n        button.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n          const li = button.closest(\"li\");\n          log.textContent = li.querySelector(\"span\").textContent + \" removed.\";\n          li.remove();\n        });\n      }\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
    "description": "Give icon-only buttons and SVG icon links an accessible name, toggle state with aria-pressed and a big enough target",
    "expectations": "# Expectations: icon-buttons\n\n1. Every `button` and `a[href]` that shows only an icon has a non-empty accessible name.\n2. Icon buttons repeated per list item (such as remove buttons) have distinct accessible names.\n3. SVG icons inside named buttons have `aria-hidden=\"true\"`, so they add nothing to the name.\n4. When the page has a toggle icon button (one that stays on or off, such as save or favourite), it exposes `aria-pressed`; activating it with Enter or Space flips the value and leaves the accessible name unchanged.\n5. Each icon button's bounding box is at least 24 by 24 CSS pixels.\n",
