    "demo": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Input purpose demo</title>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n        --bg: #ffffff;\n        --fg: #1a1a1a;\n        --accent: #0b57d0;\n      }\n      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n        :root {\n          --bg: #121212;\n          --fg: #f0f0f0;\n          --accent: #8ab4f8;\n        }\n      }\n      body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 2rem 1rem;\n        font:\n          1rem/1.5 system-ui,\n          sans-serif;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n      }\n      main {\n        max-width: 32rem;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      .field {\n        margin-bottom: 1rem;\n      }\n      label {\n        display: block;\n        font-weight: 600;\n      }\n      .check {\n        font-weight: 400;\n      }\n      input:not([type=\"checkbox\"]) {\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        width: 100%;\n        padding: 0.5rem;\n        font: inherit;\n      }\n      fieldset {\n        margin: 0 0 1rem;\n        border: 1px solid currentColor;\n      }\n      button {\n        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n        font: inherit;\n      }\n      :focus-visible {\n        outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n        outline-offset: 2px;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main>\n      <h1>Checkout</h1>\n      <form>\n        <h2>Contact</h2>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"given\">First name</label>\n          <input id=\"given\" name=\"given\" autocomplete=\"given-name\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"family\">Last name</label>\n          <input id=\"family\" name=\"family\" autocomplete=\"family-name\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"email\">Email</label>\n          <input id=\"email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"phone\">Phone</label>\n          <input id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" autocomplete=\"tel\" />\n        </div>\n        <h2>Delivery address</h2>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"street\">Street and number</label>\n          <input\n            id=\"street\"\n            name=\"street\"\n            autocomplete=\"shipping address-line1\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"city\">City</label>\n          <input id=\"city\" name=\"city\" autocomplete=\"shipping address-level2\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"postal\">Postal code</label>\n          <input\n            id=\"postal\"\n            name=\"postal\"\n            autocomplete=\"shipping postal-code\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"country\">Country</label>\n          <input\n            id=\"country\"\n            name=\"country\"\n            autocomplete=\"shipping country-name\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"submit\">Place order</button>\n      </form>\n    </main>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
    "description": "Give name, email, phone, address, payment and account fields the exact autocomplete tokens so browsers, password managers and assistive tools fill and label them",
    "expectations": "# Expectations: input-purpose\n\n1. Name fields carry the token for their label: a full name field `name`, a first name field `given-name`, a last name field `family-name`.\n2. The email field carries `email` and the phone field carries `tel`.\n3. Address fields carry their tokens, alone or after a `shipping` or `billing` prefix: street `street-address` or `address-line1`, city `address-level2`, postal code `postal-code`, country `country-name` or `country`.\n",
