    "demo": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Menu button demo</title>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n        --bg: #ffffff;\n        --fg: #1a1a1a;\n        --hover: #e8eefc;\n        --accent: #0b57d0;\n      }\n      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n        :root {\n          --bg: #121212;\n          --fg: #f0f0f0;\n          --hover: #263248;\n          --accent: #8ab4f8;\n        }\n      }\n      body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 2rem 1rem;\n        font:\n          1rem/1.5 system-ui,\n          sans-serif;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n      }\n      main {\n        max-width: 40rem;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      .wrap {\n        position: relative;\n        display: inline-block;\n      }\n      button {\n        font: inherit;\n        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n        border: 2px solid var(--fg);\n        border-radius: 0.375rem;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n        cursor: pointer;\n      }\n      :focus-visible {\n        outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n        outline-offset: 2px;\n      }\n      [role=\"menu\"] {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: calc(100% + 0.25rem);\n        left: 0;\n        min-width: 10rem;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0.25rem;\n        list-style: none;\n        border: 2px solid var(--fg);\n        border-radius: 0.375rem;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        z-index: 1;\n      }\n      [role=\"menuitem\"] {\n        padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;\n        border-radius: 0.25rem;\n        cursor: pointer;\n      }\n      [role=\"menuitem\"]:hover,\n      [role=\"menuitem\"]:focus {\n        background: var(--hover);\n        outline: 2px solid var(--accent);\n        outline-offset: -2px;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main>\n      <h1>Quarterly report.pdf</h1>\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <button\n          type=\"button\"\n          id=\"actions-button\"\n          aria-haspopup=\"menu\"\n          aria-expanded=\"false\"\n          aria-controls=\"actions-menu\"\n        >\n          Actions\n        </button>\n        <ul\n          id=\"actions-menu\"\n          role=\"menu\"\n          aria-labelledby=\"actions-button\"\n          hidden\n        >\n          <li role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\">Rename</li>\n          <li role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\">Duplicate</li>\n          <li role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\">Delete</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <p id=\"log\" role=\"status\"></p>\n      <p><a href=\"#top\">Back to files</a></p>\n    </main>\n    <script>\n      const button = document.getElementById(\"actions-button\");\n      const menu = document.getElementById(\"actions-menu\");\n      const log = document.getElementById(\"log\");\n      const items = [...menu.querySelectorAll('[role=\"menuitem\"]')];\n      const activate = (item) => {\n        log.textContent = item.textContent + \" chosen.\";\n      };\n\n      function open(index) {\n        menu.hidden = false;\n        button.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", \"true\");\n        items.at(index).focus();\n      }\n      function close(returnFocus) {\n        menu.hidden = true;\n        button.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", \"false\");\n        if (returnFocus) button.focus();\n      }\n      button.addEventListener(\"click\", () =>\n        menu.hidden ? open(0) : close(true)\n      );\n      button.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (e) => {\n        if (e.key === \"ArrowDown\") {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          open(0);\n        }\n        if (e.key === \"ArrowUp\") {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          open(-1);\n        }\n      });\n      menu.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (e) => {\n        const i = items.indexOf(document.activeElement);\n        const moves = { ArrowDown: i + 1, ArrowUp: i - 1, Home: 0, End: -1 };\n        if (e.key in moves) {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          items.at(moves[e.key] % items.length).focus();\n          return;\n        }\n        if (e.key === \"Escape\") {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          close(true);\n          return;\n        }\n        if (e.key === \"Tab\") {\n          close(false);\n          return;\n        }\n        if (e.key === \"Enter\" || e.key === \" \") {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          activate(document.activeElement);\n          close(true);\n          return;\n        }\n        if (e.key.length === 1) {\n          const next =\n            items.find(\n              (item, n) =>\n                n > i &&\n                item.textContent.toLowerCase().startsWith(e.key.toLowerCase())\n            ) ??\n            items.find((item) =>\n              item.textContent.toLowerCase().startsWith(e.key.toLowerCase())\n            );\n          next?.focus();\n        }\n      });\n      menu.addEventListener(\"click\", (e) => {\n        const item = e.target.closest('[role=\"menuitem\"]');\n        if (item) {\n          activate(item);\n          close(true);\n        }\n      });\n      document.addEventListener(\"pointerdown\", (e) => {\n        if (!menu.hidden && !menu.contains(e.target) && e.target !== button)\n          close(false);\n      });\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
    "description": "Build an accessible actions dropdown menu button with role menu, arrow keys and Escape, or a nav dropdown without it",
    "expectations": "# Expectations: menu-button\n\n1. The trigger is a `button` with `aria-haspopup` of `menu` or `true` and `aria-expanded=\"false\"` while the menu is closed.\n2. Pressing Arrow Down on the focused trigger opens an element with role `menu`, sets `aria-expanded=\"true\"` and focuses its first `menuitem`.\n3. Pressing Arrow Down on the last menu item moves focus to the first item; Arrow Up on the first moves to the last.\n4. Pressing Escape in the open menu closes it, sets `aria-expanded=\"false\"` and focuses the trigger.\n5. Menu items are not in the Tab order: pressing Tab in the open menu closes the menu and focus leaves it.\n6. Pressing Enter on a menu item closes the menu and focuses the trigger.\n",
