    "demo": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Screen orientation demo</title>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n        --bg: #ffffff;\n        --fg: #1a1a1a;\n        --card: #f2f2f2;\n        --accent: #0b57d0;\n        --on-accent: #ffffff;\n      }\n      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n        :root {\n          --bg: #121212;\n          --fg: #f0f0f0;\n          --card: #1f1f1f;\n          --accent: #8ab4f8;\n          --on-accent: #062e6f;\n        }\n      }\n      body {\n        margin: 0;\n        font:\n          1rem/1.5 system-ui,\n          sans-serif;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n      }\n      header {\n        position: sticky;\n        top: 0;\n        padding: 1rem;\n        background: var(--card);\n      }\n      main {\n        padding: 1rem;\n      }\n      ul {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(10rem, 1fr));\n        gap: 1rem;\n        padding: 0;\n        list-style: none;\n      }\n      li {\n        padding: 1rem;\n        border-radius: 0.5rem;\n        background: var(--card);\n      }\n      button {\n        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n        border: 0;\n        border-radius: 0.25rem;\n        background: var(--accent);\n        color: var(--on-accent);\n        font: inherit;\n      }\n      @media (orientation: landscape) and (max-height: 500px) {\n        header {\n          position: static;\n          padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n        }\n        h1 {\n          margin: 0;\n          font-size: 1.25rem;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <header><h1>Fjell Outdoor</h1></header>\n    <main>\n      <p>\n        This page works with the phone held either way: in a short landscape\n        view the header stops sticking and the grid adds columns.\n      </p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>\n          <h2>Rain jacket</h2>\n          <p>89 EUR</p>\n          <button type=\"button\">Add to cart</button>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <h2>Hiking boot</h2>\n          <p>139 EUR</p>\n          <button type=\"button\">Add to cart</button>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <h2>Day pack 24 L</h2>\n          <p>59 EUR</p>\n          <button type=\"button\">Add to cart</button>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </main>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
    "description": "Portrait-only or landscape-only layouts, \"rotate your device\" or \"turn your phone upright\" overlays and screen.orientation.lock. The page must work with the device held either way",
    "expectations": "# Expectations: orientation\n\n1. On a phone held sideways (844 x 390), the main content's first control is visible and on top: nothing covers it.\n2. On a phone held sideways, no message asks to turn or rotate the device.\n3. On a phone held upright (390 x 844), the main content's first control is visible and on top as well.\n",
