    "demo": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Reduced motion demo</title>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n        --bg: #ffffff;\n        --fg: #1a1a1a;\n        --slide: #e8eefc;\n        --accent: #0b57d0;\n      }\n      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n        :root {\n          --bg: #121212;\n          --fg: #f0f0f0;\n          --slide: #263248;\n          --accent: #8ab4f8;\n        }\n      }\n      html {\n        scroll-behavior: smooth;\n      }\n      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n        html {\n          scroll-behavior: auto;\n        }\n      }\n      body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 2rem 1rem;\n        font:\n          1rem/1.5 system-ui,\n          sans-serif;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n      }\n      main {\n        max-width: 40rem;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      button {\n        font: inherit;\n        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n        border: 2px solid var(--fg);\n        border-radius: 0.375rem;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n        cursor: pointer;\n      }\n      :focus-visible {\n        outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n        outline-offset: 2px;\n      }\n      .carousel {\n        border: 2px solid var(--fg);\n        border-radius: 0.5rem;\n        padding: 1rem;\n      }\n      .controls {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 0.5rem;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        margin-bottom: 1rem;\n      }\n      .slide {\n        background: var(--slide);\n        border-radius: 0.375rem;\n        padding: 2rem 1rem;\n      }\n      .slide h3 {\n        margin-top: 0;\n      }\n      .panel {\n        margin-top: 1rem;\n        padding: 1rem;\n        border: 2px solid var(--fg);\n        border-radius: 0.375rem;\n        transition:\n          transform 300ms ease,\n          opacity 300ms ease;\n      }\n      .panel[data-state=\"closed\"] {\n        transform: translateY(1rem);\n        opacity: 0;\n        visibility: hidden;\n      }\n      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n        .panel {\n          transition: opacity 150ms linear;\n        }\n        .panel[data-state=\"closed\"] {\n          transform: none;\n        }\n      }\n      a {\n        color: var(--accent);\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main>\n      <h1>Autumn collection</h1>\n      <section\n        class=\"carousel\"\n        aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"\n        aria-labelledby=\"carousel-title\"\n      >\n        <h2 id=\"carousel-title\">Featured</h2>\n        <div class=\"controls\">\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"toggle\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n            Pause slides\n          </button>\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"prev\">Previous slide</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"next\">Next slide</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"slide\" id=\"slide\" aria-live=\"off\">\n          <h3 id=\"slide-title\">Rain jackets</h3>\n          <p id=\"slide-text\">Waterproof shells for wet hikes.</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <p>\n        <button\n          type=\"button\"\n          id=\"reveal\"\n          aria-expanded=\"false\"\n          aria-controls=\"details\"\n        >\n          Show size guide\n        </button>\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"panel\" id=\"details\" data-state=\"closed\">\n        <p>Measure your chest and compare it with the chart on the label.</p>\n      </div>\n      <p><a href=\"#carousel-title\">Back to featured</a></p>\n    </main>\n    <script>\n      const slides = [\n        [\"Rain jackets\", \"Waterproof shells for wet hikes.\"],\n        [\"Hiking boots\", \"Grippy soles for rock and mud.\"],\n        [\"Wool layers\", \"Warm when wet, soft on skin.\"],\n      ];\n      const reduce = window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\");\n      const slide = document.getElementById(\"slide\");\n      const title = document.getElementById(\"slide-title\");\n      const text = document.getElementById(\"slide-text\");\n      const toggle = document.getElementById(\"toggle\");\n      const carousel = document.querySelector(\".carousel\");\n      let index = 0;\n      let timer = null;\n      let userPaused = reduce.matches;\n      let hovering = false;\n\n      function show(i) {\n        index = (i + slides.length) % slides.length;\n        [title.textContent, text.textContent] = slides[index];\n      }\n      function sync() {\n        const running = !userPaused && !hovering && !reduce.matches;\n        clearInterval(timer);\n        timer = running ? setInterval(() => show(index + 1), 5000) : null;\n        toggle.setAttribute(\"aria-pressed\", String(userPaused));\n        slide.setAttribute(\n          \"aria-live\",\n          userPaused || reduce.matches ? \"polite\" : \"off\"\n        );\n      }\n      toggle.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        userPaused = !userPaused;\n        sync();\n      });\n      document\n        .getElementById(\"prev\")\n        .addEventListener(\"click\", () => show(index - 1));\n      document\n        .getElementById(\"next\")\n        .addEventListener(\"click\", () => show(index + 1));\n      carousel.addEventListener(\"pointerenter\", () => {\n        hovering = true;\n        sync();\n      });\n      carousel.addEventListener(\"pointerleave\", () => {\n        hovering = false;\n        sync();\n      });\n      carousel.addEventListener(\"focusin\", () => {\n        hovering = true;\n        sync();\n      });\n      carousel.addEventListener(\"focusout\", (e) => {\n        if (!carousel.contains(e.relatedTarget)) {\n          hovering = false;\n          sync();\n        }\n      });\n      reduce.addEventListener(\"change\", () => {\n        if (reduce.matches) userPaused = true;\n        sync();\n      });\n\n      const reveal = document.getElementById(\"reveal\");\n      const details = document.getElementById(\"details\");\n      reveal.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        const open = reveal.getAttribute(\"aria-expanded\") === \"true\";\n        reveal.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", String(!open));\n        details.dataset.state = open ? \"closed\" : \"open\";\n      });\n      sync();\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
    "description": "Respect prefers-reduced-motion in CSS and JavaScript animations, and give carousels and autoplay a pause control",
    "expectations": "# Expectations: reduced-motion\n\n1. With `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` emulated, the page's text does not change on its own within 10 seconds of load (carousels and tickers do not advance).\n2. Without reduced motion, when the page's text changes on its own (auto-advancing content), a visible button named with \"pause\" or \"stop\" is reachable with focus, and after activating it the text does not change for 10 seconds.\n3. With `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` emulated, the computed `scroll-behavior` of the root and body elements is `auto`.\n4. With `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` emulated, scrolling through the page starts no running animation of `transform`, `translate`, `scale` or `rotate`, and no element's computed `transform` changes.\n5. With reduced motion emulated, after scrolling through the page every heading (h1 to h3) and image in `main` is visible (not left hidden or at opacity 0 by an entrance effect).\n",
