    "demo": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Delivery details demo</title>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n        --bg: #ffffff;\n        --fg: #1a1a1a;\n        --muted: #4a4a4a;\n        --accent: #0b57d0;\n      }\n      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n        :root {\n          --bg: #121212;\n          --fg: #f0f0f0;\n          --muted: #c4c4c4;\n          --accent: #8ab4f8;\n        }\n      }\n      body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 2rem 1rem;\n        font:\n          1rem/1.5 system-ui,\n          sans-serif;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n      }\n      main {\n        max-width: 32rem;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      .field {\n        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n      }\n      label {\n        display: block;\n        font-weight: 600;\n      }\n      .hint {\n        margin: 0 0 0.25rem;\n        color: var(--muted);\n      }\n      .opt {\n        font-weight: 400;\n      }\n      input[type=\"text\"],\n      input[type=\"email\"],\n      input[type=\"tel\"] {\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        width: 100%;\n        font: inherit;\n        padding: 0.5rem;\n        border: 2px solid var(--fg);\n        border-radius: 0.375rem;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n      }\n      fieldset {\n        border: 2px solid var(--muted);\n        border-radius: 0.375rem;\n        margin: 0 0 1.25rem;\n        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n      }\n      legend {\n        font-weight: 600;\n        padding: 0 0.25rem;\n      }\n      fieldset label {\n        font-weight: 400;\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 0.5rem;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 0.25rem 0;\n      }\n      input[type=\"radio\"] {\n        width: 1.25rem;\n        height: 1.25rem;\n        accent-color: var(--accent);\n      }\n      button {\n        font: inherit;\n        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n        border: 2px solid var(--fg);\n        border-radius: 0.375rem;\n        background: var(--fg);\n        color: var(--bg);\n        cursor: pointer;\n      }\n      :focus-visible {\n        outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n        outline-offset: 2px;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main>\n      <h1>Delivery details</h1>\n      <p>All fields are required unless marked optional.</p>\n      <form>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"full-name\">Full name</label>\n          <input\n            id=\"full-name\"\n            name=\"name\"\n            type=\"text\"\n            autocomplete=\"name\"\n            required\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"email\">Email address</label>\n          <p id=\"email-hint\" class=\"hint\">\n            We send the receipt and tracking link here.\n          </p>\n          <input\n            id=\"email\"\n            name=\"email\"\n            type=\"email\"\n            autocomplete=\"email\"\n            required\n            aria-describedby=\"email-hint\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"phone\">Phone number</label>\n          <p id=\"phone-hint\" class=\"hint\">\n            Include the country code, like +420.\n          </p>\n          <input\n            id=\"phone\"\n            name=\"phone\"\n            type=\"tel\"\n            autocomplete=\"tel\"\n            required\n            aria-describedby=\"phone-hint\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"company\"\n            >Company <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label\n          >\n          <input\n            id=\"company\"\n            name=\"company\"\n            type=\"text\"\n            autocomplete=\"organization\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"postal\">Postal code</label>\n          <input\n            id=\"postal\"\n            name=\"postal\"\n            type=\"text\"\n            inputmode=\"numeric\"\n            autocomplete=\"shipping postal-code\"\n            required\n          />\n        </div>\n        <fieldset>\n          <legend>Delivery speed</legend>\n          <label\n            ><input\n              type=\"radio\"\n              name=\"speed\"\n              value=\"standard\"\n              checked\n              required\n            />\n            Standard, 3 to 5 days</label\n          >\n          <label\n            ><input type=\"radio\" name=\"speed\" value=\"express\" /> Express, next\n            day</label\n          >\n        </fieldset>\n        <button>Continue to payment</button>\n      </form>\n    </main>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
    "description": "Label form inputs, mark required fields and attach hint text with label, required, aria-describedby and autocomplete",
    "expectations": "# Expectations: required-and-hints\n\n1. Every visible text input, select and textarea is labelled by a visible `label` element or by `aria-labelledby` text; none relies on `placeholder` or `aria-label` alone.\n2. Fields asked to be required have the `required` attribute (or `aria-required=\"true\"` on a custom control), and the marking is in text: every required field's label says \"required\" or has an asterisk, or the optional fields' labels say \"optional\".\n3. A field with a visible hint has that hint text in its accessible description.\n4. Radio buttons that answer one question are inside a `fieldset` whose `legend` text is the group's accessible name.\n5. Fields labelled as a name, an email address or a phone number have the `autocomplete` tokens `name` (or `given-name`/`family-name`), `email` and `tel`.\n6. Clicking a visible label moves focus to its field.\n",
