    "demo": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>Status messages demo</title>\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        color-scheme: light dark;\n        --bg: #ffffff;\n        --fg: #1a1a1a;\n        --toast: #1a1a1a;\n        --toast-fg: #ffffff;\n        --accent: #0b57d0;\n      }\n      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n        :root {\n          --bg: #121212;\n          --fg: #f0f0f0;\n          --toast: #f0f0f0;\n          --toast-fg: #121212;\n          --accent: #8ab4f8;\n        }\n      }\n      body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 2rem 1rem;\n        font:\n          1rem/1.5 system-ui,\n          sans-serif;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n      }\n      main {\n        max-width: 40rem;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n      }\n      button {\n        font: inherit;\n        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n        border: 2px solid var(--fg);\n        border-radius: 0.375rem;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--fg);\n        cursor: pointer;\n      }\n      :focus-visible {\n        outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n        outline-offset: 2px;\n      }\n      .visually-hidden {\n        position: absolute;\n        width: 1px;\n        height: 1px;\n        margin: -1px;\n        padding: 0;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        clip-path: inset(50%);\n        white-space: nowrap;\n        border: 0;\n      }\n      #toast {\n        position: fixed;\n        bottom: 1rem;\n        left: 50%;\n        translate: -50% 0;\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 1rem;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n        border-radius: 0.5rem;\n        background: var(--toast);\n        color: var(--toast-fg);\n        max-width: calc(100vw - 2rem);\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n      }\n      #toast button {\n        background: transparent;\n        color: var(--toast-fg);\n        border-color: var(--toast-fg);\n        padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\n      }\n      #toast:not([hidden]) {\n        animation: rise 0.2s ease-out;\n      }\n      @keyframes rise {\n        from {\n          translate: -50% 1rem;\n          opacity: 0;\n        }\n      }\n      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n        #toast:not([hidden]) {\n          animation: none;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main>\n      <h1>Rain jacket</h1>\n      <p>Waterproof, breathable, 380 g.</p>\n      <p><button type=\"button\" id=\"add\">Add to cart</button></p>\n      <p>Items in cart: <span id=\"count\">0</span></p>\n    </main>\n    <div id=\"status\" role=\"status\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></div>\n    <div id=\"toast\" hidden>\n      <span id=\"toast-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"dismiss\">Dismiss</button>\n    </div>\n    <script>\n      const add = document.getElementById(\"add\");\n      const count = document.getElementById(\"count\");\n      const status = document.getElementById(\"status\");\n      const toast = document.getElementById(\"toast\");\n      const toastText = document.getElementById(\"toast-text\");\n      let items = 0;\n      let timer;\n      let paused = false;\n\n      function announce(message) {\n        status.textContent = \"\";\n        setTimeout(() => {\n          status.textContent = message;\n        }, 50);\n      }\n      function schedule() {\n        clearTimeout(timer);\n        timer = setTimeout(() => {\n          if (!paused) toast.hidden = true;\n        }, 8000);\n      }\n      function showToast(message) {\n        toastText.textContent = message;\n        toast.hidden = false;\n        schedule();\n      }\n      add.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        items += 1;\n        count.textContent = String(items);\n        const message =\n          \"Rain jacket added to cart. \" +\n          items +\n          (items === 1 ? \" item\" : \" items\") +\n          \" in cart.\";\n        announce(message);\n        showToast(message);\n      });\n      document.getElementById(\"dismiss\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        toast.hidden = true;\n        add.focus();\n      });\n      for (const [type, value] of [\n        [\"pointerenter\", true],\n        [\"pointerleave\", false],\n        [\"focusin\", true],\n        [\"focusout\", false],\n      ]) {\n        toast.addEventListener(type, () => {\n          paused = value;\n          if (!value) schedule();\n        });\n      }\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
    "description": "Announce toasts, snackbars, \"added to cart\" and save confirmations to screen readers with role status, aria-live and no focus move",
    "expectations": "# Expectations: status-messages-toast\n\n1. An element with role `status` (or `aria-live=\"polite\"`) is in the DOM on page load, before any action.\n2. Activating the action (for example \"Add to cart\") puts a message naming the result into that same pre-existing live region.\n3. After the action, `document.activeElement` is still the control that was activated.\n4. Success messages are not in an element with role `alert` or `aria-live=\"assertive\"`.\n5. A visible toast remains visible for at least 5 seconds, and stays visible while it has focus or is hovered. A toast faded to `opacity: 0` or set to `visibility: hidden` counts as hidden, even when its element stays in the page.\n6. A toast close button has an accessible name.\n",
